cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this harness or its measured baselines, please cite it as below."
title: "Velocity ARMv8 Memory Bus Evaluation Harness"
abstract: >-
  A zero-allocation userspace harness for measuring contiguous memory bus
  throughput on ARMv8-A (AArch64), with cross-validation against an independent
  C implementation, and an empirical demonstration that per-iteration timing of
  sub-100 ns memory operations using CNTVCT_EL0 is unsound in both directions
  depending on barrier choice.
authors:
  - family-names: "Darcelien"
    given-names: "Timothy"
    affiliation: "Velocity Technical Infrastructure Statutory Trust"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-14"
url: "https://github.com/velocity-trust/velocity-membus-benchmark"
repository-code: "https://github.com/velocity-trust/velocity-membus-benchmark"
license: "Apache-2.0"
keywords:
  - aarch64
  - armv8
  - cortex-a72
  - bcm2711
  - memory-bus
  - benchmarking
  - microarchitecture
